spec.section:
## H.6 Explicitly unsupported in this revision

- agent or peer direct writes to `/chd/*`, `/sessions/*`, or `/gaps/*`;
- shell/CLI worker launch as authority (worker dispatch is HTTP and profile/runtime-bound);
- webhook use for operations other than `signal_ingress`;
- CHD binary image/PDF upload or content processing;
- blind SQLite copying into a replacement Hermes session database;
- implicit human approval, implicit permission resync, automatic policy widening, or connectivity-as-VP;
- undocumented operation names, unregistered workflow versions, and unversioned payloads.
